+++<h3>5.5 Authoring-side offline flag — three placement options (OPEN)</h3>
+++<p>The SDK reads <code>scopeDetails.characteristics.mobileParameters.offline</code> from the Edge proposition. <strong>Where authors set this in AJO UI is not yet decided.</strong> Three options under discussion:</p>
